          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;What will be the output of the following JavaScript code?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;let count = 0;&lt;br&gt;const intervalId = setInterval(() =&amp;gt; {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; count += 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; console.log(count);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; if (count === 3) {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; clearInterval(intervalId);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; }&lt;br&gt;}, 1000);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The answers show output in one line versus the actually multiline because of system limitations. &lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
